CHAPTER.VERS:
Therefore say to the house of Israel, Thus says the Sovereign Yahweh: Return

          {+}
        , and turn yourselves from your

          {+}
         idols; and turn away your

          {+}
         faces from all your

          {+}
         disgusting things.

and I will set my face against that man, and will make him an astonishment, for a sign and a proverb, and I will cut him off from the midst of my people; and you

          {+}
         will know that I am Yahweh.

Yet, look, in it will be left a remnant that will be carried forth, both sons and daughters: look, they will come forth to you

          {+}
        , and you

          {+}
         will see their way and their doings; and you

          {+}
         will be comforted concerning the evil that I have brought on Jerusalem, even concerning all that I have brought on it.

And they will comfort you

          {+}
        , when you

          {+}
         see their way and their doings; and you

          {+}
         will know that I have not done without cause all that I have done in it, says the Sovereign Yahweh.
